ina finds a moment of peace with Mal. Trouble awaits Kaz, Inej and Jesper upon their return to Ketterdam.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lUXwabvy32cxMZ4b0Hz7Yz36BYe.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1NoYWRvdy1hbmQtQm9uZS0lMjgyMDIxLSUyOS8.2.2","title":"Rusalye","season":2,"episode":2,"released":"2023-03-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Alina and Mal embark on a search for the second amplifier. Kaz hatches a scheme to lay waste to his nemesis. Kirigan seeks a cure for what ails him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ipalCrt0YFknvjsLklUTnqeFolh.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1NoYWRvdy1hbmQtQm9uZS0lMjgyMDIxLSUyOS8.2.3","title":"Like Calls to Like","season":2,"episode":3,"released":"2023-03-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A powerful ally emerges amid Alina's attempt to tear down the Fold. Kaz reckons with ghosts from his past. Kirigan spares no mercy to expand his power.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p2iPlnUjPVK69uee6nXcKBhCeIM.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1NoYWRvdy1hbmQtQm9uZS0lMjgyMDIxLSUyOS8.2.4","title":"Every Monstrous Thing","season":2,"episode":4,"released":"2023-03-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Alina considers a proposed partnership that could help unite Ravka. With vengeance nearly his, Kaz moves the final pieces of his plan into place.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2ZBjA5XM68g5XtSl7PruY8lBLF9.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1NoYWRvdy1hbmQtQm9uZS0lMjgyMDIxLSUyOS8.2.5","title":"Yuyeh Sesh (Despise Your Heart)","season":2,"episode":5,"released":"2023-03-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Alina's connection to Kirigan grows increasingly unstable after his latest strike. The Crows head to Shu Han on a mission to retrieve a legendary sword.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fECZSvQu2gpjaDB3B0pafNyVSB8.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1NoYWRvdy1hbmQtQm9uZS0lMjgyMDIxLSUyOS8.2.6","title":"Ni Weh Sesh (I Have No Heart)","season":2,"episode":6,"released":"2023-03-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Alina and Mal's journey to locate the elusive third amplifier leads to shocking revelations. The Crows run into trouble while breaking and entering.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5jyOp8JXlki5CC5IAF7jVCsakbp.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1NoYWRvdy1hbmQtQm9uZS0lMjgyMDIxLSUyOS8.2.7","title":"Meet You in the Meadow","season":2,"episode":7,"released":"2023-03-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Alina reels over the staggering cost to harness the Firebird's power, Kirigan readies his army for a ferocious battle pitting Grisha against Grisha.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7fx5pGFfImojPFDaBCwO3Dpz3Rp.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1NoYWRvdy1hbmQtQm9uZS0lMjgyMDIxLSUyOS8.2.8","title":"No Funerals","season":2,"episode":8,"released":"2023-03-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Forced into an impossible situation during her fight with Kirigan, Alina makes a fateful decision that alters her relationship with magic — and Mal.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b3iizV97RyteB2lkrt1bAYE43EQ.jpg"}]}}